Subject: [PATCH 5.15 032/290] powerpc/rtas: avoid device tree lookups in rtas_os_term()
Date: Tue, 10 Jan 2023 19:02:04 +0100
Message-Id: <20230110180032.692680319@linuxfoundation.org>
